(3) Corollary T1 -- units: tau_C = tau_K <=> rho = 1/alpha <=> |b| = 1; product = (alpha-2)^-2
    alpha=  2.4142  X^2-2X-1   product=  5.8284   FULL SUPPORT (proved)
    alpha=  2.6180  X^2-3X+1   product=  2.6180   FULL SUPPORT (proved)
    alpha=  3.3028  X^2-3X-1   product=  0.5892
    alpha=  3.7321  X^2-4X+1   product=  0.3333
    alpha=  4.2361  X^2-4X-1   product=  0.2000
    alpha=  4.7913  X^2-5X+1   product=  0.1283
    alpha=  5.1926  X^2-5X-1   product=  0.0981
    alpha=  5.8284  X^2-6X+1   product=  0.0682
    => exactly two quadratic Pisot units in (2,3]: 1+sqrt2 and (3+sqrt5)/2.

